        Spring Boot 4.0.3: aguardando release 4.0.4 (só 4.1.0-RC1 disponível).
        Mitigação: gateway mTLS/JWT + actuator restrito.
        ]]></notes>
        <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/org\.springframework\.boot/.*@4\.0\..*$</packageUrl>
        <vulnerabilityName>CVE-2026-40972</vulnerabilityName>
    </suppress>
    <suppress until="2026-12-31Z">
